Close completed movie audio before sending the success notification.

Wine MCIAVI_player resets WaveOut and closes its device before notifying
MCI_NOTIFY_SUCCESSFUL. The portable backend previously deferred reset until
the game's later MCI_CLOSE call, allowing native silence production and the
browser AudioContext to remain active across the completion callback.

Reset immediately after a successful drain query. Error and cancellation
paths already reset before notifying; the later close remains idempotent.
This does not establish equal whole original PCM tails or A/V timing.

--- a/dd2_movie.c
+++ b/dd2_movie.c
@@ -77,7 +77,7 @@
             draining=1;
             int status=dd2_movie_audio_done();
             if(status<0){dd2_movie_audio_stop();finish(8);}
-            else if(status)finish(1);
+            else if(status){dd2_movie_audio_stop();finish(1);}
             else drain_poll_ms=dd2_movie_now_ms();
         }
     }
